            question: list all hod in different medicine department?
query: SELECT Id, EmployeeName, DepartmentName, DesignationName FROM emp.vw_EmployeesList WHERE LOWER(DepartmentName) LIKE LOWER('%MEDICINE%') and LOWER(DesignationName) LIKE LOWER('%HOD%') 

