Table Name: emp.BioAttendance -  biometric attendance logs of employees.
 column are given below
 Id - 
 EmployeeId - 
 SiftTypeId - 
 AttendanceDate - Timestamp when the biometric attendance was recorded.
 RosterDate - 
 PunchMode -  Indicates whether the punch is an "In" or "Out" entry.
 FingerType - 
 SerialNo - Serial number of the biometric device.
 ModelNo - 
 FileNo - 
 LocalMAC - MAC address of the local system capturing attendance.
 LocalIP - 
 SystemIP - 
 EntryType - 
 CreateDate - 
 CreateUserId - 
 UpdatedInTime - Time of last update to the In-time 
 UpdatedOutTime -  Time of last update to the Out-time
 SiftChCreateDate - 
